window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In this sultry romance series, shy and submissive college student Sienna finds herself captivated by her history professor, Donovan. Behind his professional demeanor lies a man who awakens desires she never knew she had. What begins as an innocent infatuation quickly spirals into a seductive power dynamic, filled with tension, secrets, and boundaries both tested and broken.</p> <p>As their connection deepens, the arrival of Lisa—manipulative, stunning, and unapologetically bold—complicates their already fragile dynamic. With Sienna torn between her loyalty to Donovan and her undeniable curiosity for Lisa, every encounter becomes a game of control, seduction, and submission.</p> <p>Set against the backdrop of a quiet community college, intimate getaways, and holiday surprises, The Professor’s Brat explores themes of desire, power, and the lengths one will go to protect what they crave most. For fans of slow-burning tension and steamy relationships, this series delivers a tantalizing escape into a world of forbidden passion and unrelenting temptation.</p>"; 
